WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.870
Shusei's gone...

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:06.790
Let go!

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:08.480
Release me!

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.230
Let go of me, Tsukumo!

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:12.640
Calm down! What are you doing?

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.260
I'm going to look for him!

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:15.480
Look for him? Where?

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.580
Everywhere!

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:21.800
I told you, even I can't
tell where he is!

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.440
You said you'd stay with me.

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:34.080
You said you'd always stay with me...

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:38.530
<i>Shusei!</i>

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:44.620
Only I know your pain...

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:47.120
Your uncertainty...

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:50.070
Your loneliness...

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:55.300
If only we could be together forever.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:01.640
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.850
I will not betray you!

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:56.910
Cry of Despair

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:22.250
What happened? Why did Shusei-kun...

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:27.590
What are the odds that he
disappeared on his own?

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:29.620
Impossible!

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:33.690
There's no way he'd disappear like this,
without saying anything to me!

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:38.030
If that's the case, does that
mean Duras are involved?

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:42.410
There's no point in speculating.

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:47.550
The full force of the World's End
is searching for Shusei.

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:51.650
In the meantime,
you Zweilt should wait here.

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:53.560
Wait?

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:56.590
We cannot afford any more
unnecessary sacrifices.

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:57.890
Sacrifices?

00:03:57.890 --> 00:04:01.350
Is that how you think of Shusei?
I'm going to look for him!

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:03.900
I'll find him!

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:06.120
I can't let you do that.

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:09.440
I don't need your permission.

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:14.490
Hotsuma-kun!

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:21.600
Tachibana, take Hotsuma to his room.

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:22.950
Takashiro-san!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:33.060
Isn't there anything we can do?

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:52.660
Shusei...

00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:07.600
Where am I?

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:22.140
Those men...

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:27.890
The missing people that World's End
was searching for.

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:30.210
You...

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:31.310
Quiet.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:33.770
Ashley-sama will be here soon.

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:35.140
Ashley?

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:38.490
What's that supposed to mean?

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:44.140
Why can't the newcomer be hypnotized?

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:48.000
I'm not sure...

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.370
An Opast!

00:05:57.420 --> 00:06:00.050
Oh, my. This human...

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:02.590
is just my type!

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:05.260
He's what I was waiting for!

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:09.120
He's not just a pretty face.
He seems smart, too.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:10.970
There she goes again.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:14.920
Ashley-sama only cares for her pretty boy.

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:17.780
Shut up.

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:26.100
Now it's time to add you
to my doll collection...

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:28.800
Or so I'd like to say.

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:34.170
But unfortunately, it seems you
really are too good to be true!

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:45.260
You're a Zweilt, aren't you?

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:51.730
But if you're here, that means
you're someone's beloved.

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:03.820
She's that girl from Hotsuma's class.

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:11.700
That handkerchief...

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:16.080
What are you planning?

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:21.270
All right. I guess handsome men
deserve special treatment.

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:24.430
I'll tell you before I kill you.

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:31.840
I saved poor girls from the
pain of unrequited love.

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:36.600
Wanting to be loved...
Unwilling to give up...

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:41.650
Uncertainty, jealousy, possessiveness,

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:45.880
and one-sided love are all emotions
overflowing with defeat.

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:49.780
I simply took that power.

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:58.170
In exchange, I allowed those girls to die,
dreaming of the men they desired.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:03.210
So this is the truth behind
the Sleeping Beauty syndrome.

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:07.590
I'm just a substitute for Hotsuma.

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:10.240
Isn't it romantic?

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:14.670
By the way, my puppets are the
girls' romantic interests,

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:17.380
upon whom I've cast my spell.

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:21.720
This situation simply works out for everyone.

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:27.000
I never expected to get a Zweilt, though.
I must be a genius!

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:34.620
That impudent expression...

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:37.920
I know. I've got a great idea.

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:47.350
Don't come here, Hotsuma!

00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:00.870
I brought you dinner.
Toma-san baked this.

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:04.860
I don't need any more of his tomato bread.

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:07.360
No tomato bread today.

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:10.630
You can pass through it, huh?

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:13.830
The barrier Takashiro constructed...

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:16.680
I can't get a hair through.

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:30.650
Have you ever wanted to
stop being who you are?

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:34.720
Yes, I have.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.610
I thought you'd say that.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:44.980
I tried to kill myself...

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:53.540
I wanted to be free of this damned power.

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:55.910
So I burned myself.

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:04.380
Shusei was the one who
dragged me out of that fire.

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:08.290
Stupid story, huh?

00:10:08.970 --> 00:10:14.890
When I gave him that indelible wound,
I finally realized something.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:20.350
Even if the world turns its back
on me, I have Shusei.

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:26.730
I was able to choose life because of him.

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:31.410
It only could have been him.

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:36.120
I'm sure Shusei-kun feels the same way.

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:37.870
Shusei, too?

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:44.750
But he was always the one supporting me.

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:50.880
When did he start to have that expression?

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:53.200
Hotsuma-kun?

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:56.680
There's a ton of things I want to ask him.

00:10:56.680 --> 00:11:00.560
Where are you, Shusei?

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:07.480
Oh, Yuki-kun!

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:09.320
Tachibana-san.

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:12.440
Hurry. The leader's calling us.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:20.450
I just received this video from
the police department.

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:24.040
It was found in the room of the newest
Sleeping Beauty syndrome victim,

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:28.820
high school student Yoshino Shiori.

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:30.950
Yoshino-san?

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:32.400
You know her?

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:34.380
She's in my class.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:36.830
Watch it.

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:41.820
Hi. Nice to meet you,

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:44.740
Giou Clan half-wits.

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:48.270
I am Ashley-sama, the orgulous Opast.

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:49.710
An Opast?

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:52.620
Let's cut to the chase.

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:57.490
I've got this handsome gentleman
in my custody!

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:12.120
Shusei-kun!

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:16.090
If you want him back,
you'll have to trade God's Light.

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:18.840
You have two days.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:22.350
I've sent what you'll need to get here, too.

00:12:22.870 --> 00:12:29.150
If you don't bring me God's Light,
I'll kill this Zweilt on the spot.

00:12:29.150 --> 00:12:30.980
That's all.

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:33.070
Take care.

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:39.170
It's a trap...

00:12:39.170 --> 00:12:40.200
Yes.

00:12:40.790 --> 00:12:44.160
But we still have to go!
Shusei-kun is...

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:45.580
Wait, Yuki.

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:46.620
What?

00:12:57.220 --> 00:13:01.820
I've invited your friends,

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:07.050
so why don't you tell me something, already?

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:12.890
I don't want to have to hurt you.

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:16.920
Just tell me one little thing.

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:21.620
It could be about the Zweilts'
powers or weaknesses...

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:23.530
I refuse!

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:26.280
Oh my.

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:28.870
How stubborn.

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:35.390
Why don't we stop this?

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:40.300
If you hold out too long,
I might just end up killing you.

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:43.120
It doesn't matter...

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:45.970
If you're going to kill me, kill me.

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:51.230
The Giou Clan needs only
for God's Light to live.

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:56.030
It means nothing to them
if a single Zweilt dies.

00:13:56.900 --> 00:14:03.200
Besides, I want nothing more
than to die for him.

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:09.490
Is that right?

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:12.630
I thought you seemed a little lifeless.

00:14:12.630 --> 00:14:16.470
Grown tired of living, have you?

00:14:17.950 --> 00:14:22.260
Very well. I'll save you.

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:25.300
Sleep.

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:28.100
Sleep deeply.

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:30.970
Just relax.

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:34.160
Release your consciousness.

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:38.420
Leave everything important to you behind.

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:42.320
See? You can't move.

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:45.180
This is it...

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:47.860
Hotsuma...

00:14:55.370 --> 00:15:00.080
I knew you'd make a beautiful corpse.

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:03.640
You're part of my collection now.

00:15:04.310 --> 00:15:09.170
You'll never wake up again.

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:30.670
Eat something.

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:37.710
What is Takashiro-san thinking?

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:41.460
Right now, all we can do is wait.

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:52.470
If she contacted us through this girl,

00:15:53.070 --> 00:15:57.930
it's safe to say that Ashley has been
behind all these incidents.

00:15:59.880 --> 00:16:03.400
I want the two of you to investigate this case.

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:04.390
Yes, sir.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:08.070
Takashiro-sama.

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:11.050
About Shusei...

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:15.220
As the Giou Clan leader,

00:16:15.710 --> 00:16:18.230
I intend to make the right decision.

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:21.650
Huh?

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.760
Are we allowed to go outside now?

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:28.590
No. We're going to pose as Yoshino-san's
friends and search her house.

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:33.570
She fell asleep around the
time Shusei disappeared.

00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:36.410
So Takashiro-sama thought we
might find something.

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:39.860
I understand...

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:42.280
Don't worry, Yuki.

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:44.960
We've got the charms you made for us.

00:16:47.910 --> 00:16:48.580
Okay.

00:16:49.470 --> 00:16:51.630
See you later, then!

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.270
We'll be back.

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:03.840
Something doesn't feel right.

00:17:19.170 --> 00:17:21.590
Yoshino

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:29.250
We're a year ahead of Yoshino-san,

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:32.910
so we'll have to switch our neckties.

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:38.400
Red looks good on you, too.

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:43.040
Promise me you'll give it back
when we're done, okay?

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:45.980
All right. I promise.

00:17:47.010 --> 00:17:49.260
I'll be back soon, Tsukumo.

00:17:49.260 --> 00:17:51.720
Be careful, Toko-chan.

00:17:56.760 --> 00:18:01.340
Toko-chan subconsciously tries
to make promises with me.

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:06.670
It's as though she's desperately trying
to be connected to something.

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:11.950
Is something wrong, Tsukumo-kun?

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:15.130
I heard a man scream.

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:17.410
What? I didn't hear anything.

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:18.690
I'll go see what's happening!

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:19.620
Tsukumo-kun!

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:31.460
We've got you!

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:33.680
Let's kill him! Let's kill him now!

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:36.260
Save me...

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:38.210
No, no.

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:43.230
Ashley-sama didn't want you.
You're just trash!

00:18:43.230 --> 00:18:45.900
I'm tired of playing tag.

00:18:46.340 --> 00:18:48.360
It's time to eat-

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:51.650
What?

00:18:58.010 --> 00:18:59.190
Are you all right?

00:18:59.190 --> 00:19:00.500
Please save me!

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:05.330
This man was on the missing persons list!

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:09.350
No one said we'd have a visitor!

00:19:09.350 --> 00:19:11.760
But we have to kill him.

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:13.760
Those were Ashley-sama's orders!

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:15.900
Kill me?

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:18.960
But I just got out of that place...

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:21.650
When I give you the signal,
run as fast as you can!

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:24.730
I-I can't! My legs are shaking.

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:29.190
Don't worry. Just calm down.
I will protect you.

00:19:30.090 --> 00:19:31.190
Run!

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:35.860
He's making a break for it.

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:36.910
Stop him!

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:38.160
I won't allow it!

00:19:45.970 --> 00:19:47.490
<i>Neru Pia Blanca!</i>

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:01.430
An Opast's familiar...

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:09.110
Zweilt!

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:12.990
Another one?

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:24.380
Ashley's toys are good for
something, after all.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:29.630
Who would have thought we'd catch a Zweilt?

00:20:30.650 --> 00:20:32.090
Opasts!

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:34.600
What do we do about this guy?

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:36.840
Can we kill him, Reiga-sama?

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:42.310
Yes.

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:48.270
But I will be the one to end his life!

00:20:48.270 --> 00:20:50.480
Y-You're...

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:54.240
No...

00:20:55.740 --> 00:20:57.110
Impossible!

00:21:02.830 --> 00:21:07.360
Do you still intend to fight, young hero?

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:11.500
I admire your courage.

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:13.450
I need to tell them.

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:15.800
Yuki!

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:19.630
Say your prayers.

00:21:21.390 --> 00:21:22.700
Toko-chan.

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:25.720
Goodbye.

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:48.370
Yuki.

00:21:49.510 --> 00:21:50.530
Luka,

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:53.320
did something happen?

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:57.630
They got Tsukumo.

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:36.700
Yuki.

00:23:36.700 --> 00:23:37.820
What is it, Luka?

00:23:37.820 --> 00:23:42.070
By the station, there's a sign
advertising home-style soba.

00:23:42.760 --> 00:23:45.280
"Style?" Then it probably isn't homemade.

00:23:45.280 --> 00:23:45.970
Of course not!

00:23:45.970 --> 00:23:47.560
That Which is Fleeting,
Strong, and Precious

00:23:47.560 --> 00:23:49.930
You fell for it, didn't you?
